{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-codes","title":"线性码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/linear-codes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-block-codes","title":"线性分组码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/linear-codes/linear-block-codes","wordCount":1501,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"hamming-cyclic","title":"汉明码与循环码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/linear-codes/hamming-cyclic","wordCount":1496,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"reed-solomon","title":"Reed-Solomon 码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/linear-codes/reed-solomon","wordCount":1561,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"线性码\">线性码</h1><p>基础章把码看成一堆彼此距离足够远的字符串，这一章给这堆字符串装上代数骨架。当所有码字构成一个向量空间——任意两个码字之和仍是码字——译码与分析立刻从「查表」升级为「解线性方程」，存储一个码不再需要列出全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个码字，而只需一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的生成矩阵。线性，是整个工程化编码理论的转折点。</p>\n<p>第一篇建立通用机器：生成矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 如何把信息映射为码字、校验矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 如何用一次矩阵乘法算出「症状」（syndrome）从而定位错误、标准阵与陪集首如何给出最优译码。这套语言是本章乃至后面卷积码、LDPC 的共同底座。</p>\n<p>第二篇走向有结构的具体码。汉明码是第一个能纠单错的完美码，循环码则要求码字循环移位后仍是码字，这条额外约束把生成矩阵浓缩成一个生成多项式，让编码可以用移位寄存器硬件完成——你每天用的 CRC 校验正是循环码的检错版本。</p>\n<p>第三篇是本章的高潮：Reed-Solomon 码。它把符号从比特升级到有限域元素，达到 Singleton 界（MDS 码），能以极高效率纠正突发错误，至今仍是 CD、DVD、二维码、QR 与分布式存储的主力。它对有限域运算的依赖会把我们引向抽象代数。</p>\n<p>三篇按「通用理论 → 有结构特例 → 工业级构造」递进。第一篇是理解后两篇的前提；若只关心工程应用，可先读第一篇再直接跳到 Reed-Solomon。</p>\n"}